[2.013, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m======================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36mEMPIRICAL COMPARISON & REDUCTION ANALYSIS\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m======================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.639, "o", "======================================================================\r\nCOMPARISON SUMMARY: BASELINE vs SINGLEFLIGHT\r\n======================================================================\r\n\r\nMetric                  Baseline (No Coalescing)    Singleflight (Coalesced)\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nTotal Requests          10000                       10000                   \r\nCache Misses            5367                        8052                    \r\nDatabase Queries        5367                        11                      \r\nMax DB Concurrency      4798                        1                       \r\nSingleflight Shared     N/A                         8050                    \r\nDuration                10983.72                 ms   60131.72              ms\r\nThroughput (RPS)        910.4                    req/s 166.3                 req/s\r\nLatency p50             6513.45                  ms   17375.09              ms\r\nLatency p95             7599.70                 "]
[0.000, "o", " ms   32250.01              ms\r\nLatency p99             7825.90                  ms   48301.22              ms\r\nLatency Max             10965.99                 ms   60125.37              ms\r\nErrors                  0                           0                       \r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\nANALYSIS:\r\n  * Database work reduction:    487.9x reduction in DB load\r\n  * Database queries:           5367 (baseline) -> 11 (singleflight)\r\n  * Peak DB connection demand:  4798 concurrent -> 1 concurrent\r\n  * Result sharing efficiency:  80.50% of requests piggybacked on in-flight query\r\n\r\n======================================================================\r\n"]
[2.008, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m======================================================================\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36mEXPERIMENT 3: REAL-WORLD TTL EXPIRATION BURST\u001b[0m\r\n"]
